{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_lmlee_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_lmlee_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "三餐一日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lmlee_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b58a881d86dd9f2eb9903a883271dac57c13dbd39641dd173bc6c932ba94a7bc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "先生，您在这菜市场来来回回转了快有好几圈了，是没有找到需要的食材吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你在叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "嗯，菜市场就要关门了，您再不走，就得在里面过夜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "这才不到七点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "唉，一看您就不是本地人，这里晚上乱得很，谁有胆子开门到那个时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......我确实是刚来没几天，昨天才在附近的旅馆住下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "龙门那么多地方可去，先生怎么想着要来逛一逛这小小的菜市场？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "只是我的一个小习惯，每到一个新地方，就会去看看当地的菜市场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "风俗、人情、土宜，都能在这里体现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "菜市场而已，哪会有什么不一样？不过是人来人往，吵吵闹闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "就比如......尚蜀的菜市场能彻夜不打烊，这里就不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "......先生您还要不要买菜了？不买我就收摊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "有什么推荐的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "小暑节气，天气炎热，不如买两支茭白笋回家煲粥，解热防暑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唉，还是不打扰了，旅馆里的冰箱不大，放不下这半米长的茭白笋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "唉......真是个怪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "耽误我回家......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "老板，你今天走得是不是有些早啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "（啧，这混账羔子......这么早走都避不开。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "我的钱准备好了没有？连带着上个月拖欠的，一并给了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "这、这几个月生意不景气，实在是剩不下什么孝敬给您的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "那不正好，赶紧滚蛋，把摊子给有能力的人经营。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哎哎，你做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "放手，别砸了，别砸了！再宽限些时日吧，到时我一定筹到钱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "哼，晚了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "慢着，小兄弟高抬贵手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "啧，大爷你谁啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，太抬举了，你我以兄弟相称就足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "......你给我放尊重点，也不打听打听我上面是哪位人物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "是位姓林的贵人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "既然知道，还不识相点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "（好家伙，怎么这城里遇上的混混十个里有八个都说自己是林先生的手下。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，怪不得我觉得这位小兄弟面熟，想来在林先生的宅子里见过面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "啊......见、见过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "对啊，去年林先生家里的金桂开得正好，所以做了许多糖桂花。不知道小兄弟你收到没有啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "当、当然，临走前林先生送了我十多罐，根本吃不完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎，等等......我记错了，林先生家种的好像不是桂花，是桃树。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "*龙门粗口*，你到底认不认识林先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我不一定认识，但你一定不认识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "赶紧滚吧，听说那位林先生治下颇严，要是知道有人冒用他的名号作恶，恐怕那人会吃不了兜着走啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "呸，晦气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "那个......先生，谢谢您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不过是动动嘴皮子的事情，不必介怀。下次遇上这种小人，不用害怕，多半是借势欺人的混混，真正的黑帮哪有这么不上道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "唉......我就是个小贩，哪里有什么识人的本事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "对了，先生，您先别走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "旅馆里的冰箱虽小，但这一袋荔枝应该还是放得下的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "家里种的，值不了几个钱，就是片心意，先生就带回去吃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "......先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "啊，我在想，就是为几颗荔枝的好滋味，走上这么远的路也算是值得了。多谢了，老板。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哎，先生您喜欢就好，有空记得常来光顾小摊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "一定一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "鲤先生，嘿，鲤先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，蔡老板，我还没到菜市场，就听到你在喊我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "我这不是怕留给你的这几棵冬笋不新鲜了嘛。大寒时节，正是吃冬笋的好时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "就这么几分钟的时间，哪会坏得那么快？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "带回去记得泡盐水啊，这样存得久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "算了吧，我租的房子厨房只有那么一点点大，放进保鲜袋丢冰箱就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "不行，这可是上好的白眼笋，你是个讲究人我才留给你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "你放心，过两天我要请一位贵客到屋子里坐坐，存不久的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "鲤先生你在龙门交到朋友了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "还不算朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那要怎样才能算鲤先生的朋友呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "林先生今天来帮太太买菜啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "我太太没有那么挑剔，不会因为几棵笋，就让我跑到离家十几公里外的菜市场买菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "（鲤先生，这、这位不是......不是那位......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "（你就当他是个普通过路人就行了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "鲤先生还没有回答我的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗐，我就是个市井俗人，谁在大酒楼设宴请我吃一顿，我定把他奉为知己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "手下报给我的可不一样。你这一周，出入的尽是街道巷陌的小馆子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "林先生你知道那么多我会出现的场所，为什么偏偏来这离家十几公里的菜市场寻我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "为了几棵笋不值得跑十几公里，但为了谢个朋友，还是值得的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "夸张了，我不过是帮衬着林先生你做了些小事。没有我，这局面照样也能收拾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "这话你说错了，要是没有你，收拾出来的局面还真未必比现在好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......哈，林先生，我自己几斤几两，我自己最清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "这几棵笋品相上佳，你打算怎么烧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "简简单单做个油焖笋就够鲜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "这么平实的烧法未免有些浪费，照我看，不如再提上一只现杀的羽兽回家炖汤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唉，那吃的可就不是笋的鲜甜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "何况......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "鲤先生不妨直说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哈，何况这几棵笋原本长在乡野，自有一种任心恣意的性情，想必也不愿意给其他食材作配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "怕就怕笋子生得太好，就算长在深山老林，也要引得挖笋人一波一波地来挖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "如此一来，哪还能过上安然自得的日子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哈哈，那都是后话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "魏老二可不会无缘无故地上别人家作客......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我有自信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "什么自信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "自信......一旦魏大人拿起筷子，就不会停下嘴来和我多说一句话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "哼......老板，你这里有苹果吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "有有有，林先生您拿好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "多少钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "不、不收您的钱，这些年多亏了您，大家才能安稳过日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "做生意不容易，收着吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "林先生不是说不买东西吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "来都来了，给女儿带些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，有了家室的人，到底是不一样。本来还想明年邀你一起去姜齐游湖赏花，看来是要作罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "你还是早些成家，不要到处漂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "算了吧，安顿下来过日子不是我所求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "夫人您看，这是当季的青梅，皮薄肉厚核小，味道酸中带甘，吃了口舌生津。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "您现在要是不称个几斤回家泡酒，等清明过去了，这滋味就再享受不到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "行......给我称一点吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "好好，有道是“青梅煮酒斗时新”......嗐，没什么文化，就光记得这么一句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "老蔡，老远就听到你哄着客人掏腰包，你这嘴啊......越来越滑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哎呀，做生意嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "鲤先生是这里的常客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "好久不见，夫人今天怎么想到光顾这里了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "这是龙门最大，也是货物最齐全的菜市场。我想，买食材的话，这里自然是不二之选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "什么事需要夫人亲自来采买食材？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯，彦吾几天后要过生日，我想下厨为他做几道菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "夫人想做什么菜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "......还没有想好，无非是彦吾常吃的那几道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "魏大人爱吃的那几样......可能有些考验夫人的厨艺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "咳咳，我想......有心不怕费功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "不过......我第一次来菜市场，确实不知道怎么挑，劳烦鲤先生略施援手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "没问题，就比如说这番茄，要是拿它当水果生吃，就买粉红色的，吃着口感略脆；要是炒菜，就选深红色的，味道浓厚，也容易出汁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯，我记住了。那边有芋头，我想买一些做芋泥烟肉脯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "芋头啊，如果个头差不多的话，就买重一些的那个，水多淀粉也多，吃起来软糯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "好。那香菇呢，我该买干的，还是新鲜的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "各有各的好，看夫人要做什么菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "仔姜鲜肉酿香菇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "那要用干香菇，泡发之后香味更足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哦......原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "对了，往前走还有一家卖豉油的店，正好买来制成豉油汁烧羽兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "（可是那家最近涨价了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "（老蔡，这你就多虑了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "做玫瑰豉油汁吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "鲤先生弄错了，彦吾是常吃这道菜，但其实是因为我喜欢，所以才跟着一起吃了多年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "之前听魏大人在饭桌上说起过。我想，因为夫人喜欢，所以魏大人爱屋及乌，倒也不稀奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "......噗嗤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我觉得鲤先生的嘴，比生意人还要滑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哈哈，要说生意人，最近我还真算得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你不是一向逍遥自在的吗？当初彦吾多次请你出任近卫局要职，你都拒绝了。怎么也开始愁起生计了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "家里又添了一张嘴，帮人跑跑腿多挣几个饭钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哦，你终于要成家了？改天我和彦吾必携礼登门拜访贵夫人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哪里的事......是一个老友远游去了，丢下一个孩子孤零零的，我就接过来住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "真是不负责......他有说自己什么时候回来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "没有......但总不可能真的丢下孩子不管吧。估计帮他看顾几个月，他就回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "等把孩子交还给他，我也打算学学他，远游去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "龙门不好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "好是好，可我是个浪荡人，一个地方再好也待不久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "唉，多谢鲤先生的指点，东西采买得差不多，我也该回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "夫人慢走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "鲤先生，哎，鲤先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "啊......蔡老板，找我有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "鲤先生你站这里半天了，别人还要买菜呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......不好意思，咳咳。你这进口樱桃怎么卖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "鲤先生不是嫌贵，从来不买吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唉，小丫头爱吃，买几斤回家尝尝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "老蔡，我上周在你这里定的那批食材到了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "到了到了，就等你过来取了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，不好意思，今天家里有点事情，让你久等了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "不打紧不打紧，这才九点不到，天还没黑，离关门还早呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "不过，今天怎么是你来？没让手下那个大个子学徒来跑腿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "他今天有活做，刚刚搬了新屋，他得带着槐琥和阿打扫整理房间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "搬新屋？怎么，原来的房子住不自在啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "房间太少了，招待客户不方便。厨房也太小，我还想再在里面放一个冰柜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "两个冰箱还不够啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "好多人一起吃饭哪。幸好吽也算学出来了，能帮忙一起掌勺，不然烧饭都要累死人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "要我说，你这一身本事啊，别的没人学都不可惜，唯独这厨艺，可万万不能失传。有他在，我也是放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "他啊，才学了个皮毛，还差些火候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "那今天你是打算亲自开伙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗯，他们忙了一天，也是该犒劳犒劳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哈哈，那这一盆金桔你端走吧，就当我祝你的事务所开业大吉，发大财。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎哟，这盆金桔我记得摆在店里可有好几年了，你不是一向宝贝得很，别人轻易都碰不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "这寒露刚过，才结满了果，怎么......今天说送就送给我了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "老鲤啊，不瞒你说，这菜店我不打算开下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......你要迁址了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "我该退休啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "是有十几年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "算上从前你没来的日子，快有三十年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "上个月通知传过来，说这里明年会拆掉，要改建成大型超市，虽说店铺到时可以保留下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "龙门这几年......拆掉的地方未免有些太多了，家附近的茶楼也拆了，说要改成咖啡店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "嗐，就是啊。算了，我们夫妻俩操劳这么多年，正好停下来休息休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "何况你一双儿女也都长大，各自成家离开，继续守着这家店也没有什么意思，不如到处走走，四处看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "在龙门这么多年，我们还从来没有去过大炎的其他城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "这些年存下的积蓄再加上政府补偿的拆迁费，也够我们好好玩上几年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "老鲤啊，你去过的地方那么多，有没有什么推荐啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......在龙门待了这么多年，突然让我回忆当时云游四方的经历，也确实难说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不过细细想来，不好的那些都已经是过眼烟云，记不清晰，留下来的啊......多是当地宜人的风光和温暖的人情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "还有吵闹的菜市场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈......你还记得那些话啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "等我去了尚蜀，一定第一时间去那彻夜不打烊的菜市场看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "好......好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "这么多年，回回看见你，你都说要离开龙门，结果十几年过去了，走的却是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "是啊，阴差阳错，每每要离开，每每都有事绊住了脚步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唉......老蔡，许多人临行前，都要来我这里算上一卦，卜卜吉凶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "这么多年的朋友，今天我就免费给算算，你这一路到底是个什么光景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哎，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "怎么说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "此卦乃世旺卦，属大吉之相，这一路上必然身体康健，往来平安，事事顺遂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "哈哈哈，你讲话总是这么好听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "老蔡啊，这可不是好听话，是我真心所愿。往后......我们有缘再见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜贩",
      "text": "......有缘再见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市广播",
      "text": "快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬宾，新鲜肉类买一送一。快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬宾，新鲜肉类买......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "排了这么久，吽哥，到底还要多久才能排到我们啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "再等等，今天超市大酬宾，人肯定是多些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "就为了一块腿肉，站得人腿都麻了。我练武时站桩都没有这么累。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "几天前鲤先生特意点了葱油烩腿肉，说要在生日的时候吃，正好今天超市里有新鲜现宰的，过几天再买就只有冷冻货了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "年纪一把，他反而越来越像小孩了，想吃什么，片刻都不能等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "生日就是满足心愿的日子嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "你嘴上这么说，不还是早早就买好了生日礼物藏在房间里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你......怎么知道的？都说我的房间不用你打扫了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "我没进你的房间......是丢垃圾的时候看到了一大袋子的包装纸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "唉，我也没想到包个礼物有那么难，拆了包，包了拆，好不容易才折平整。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市员工",
      "text": "先生，您要什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "来块腿肉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市员工",
      "text": "前腿后腿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "后腿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "槐琥，你有看到阿吗？怎么还没回来？一会儿拿了腿肉我们就要结账回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "不知道啊，一进超市门他就跑得没影儿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "（四处打量）啧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "看到了，那不就是他，正朝我们这边走呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你是跑去买什么了，这么久都不见人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "没什么，就是到处逛了逛，看看有什么能买给老鲤的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "什么也没看中？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "嘿嘿，没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收银员",
      "text": "你好，先生，一共四百七十一龙门币，现金还是刷卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "姑娘......这是不是算错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收银员",
      "text": "怎么会呢？都是机器算的账，不会错的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "（奇怪，怎么比我算的还要多？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "槐琥，你把手提袋打开，我再点点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "吽哥，别计较了，或许就是你算错了，赶紧提着东西回家吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "对啊对啊，出来一整天了，我看槐琥姐简直累得筋疲力尽，还是赶紧回家休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽&槐琥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "......槐琥，把袋子给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "......给，吽哥，你可得仔细看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "（哎呀，多话了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "腿肉、白萝卜、南瓜、莲藕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "哎，吽哥，袋子最底下好像有一个药材包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "阿——阿嚏！咳咳咳......好刺鼻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "咳咳咳，呸呸，这是什么东西？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "唉，不怪我，是你们非要拿出来看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "我就是觉得，你们给老鲤送的东西，啧，都太没劲了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "你们随后跟上来，我就先走啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "咳咳咳......你、你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你这个混小子，给我回来！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
